3386:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * Explanation: A register, expert_wrcalib, is described in MSS DDR TIP
3387:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * Register Map [1], and its purpose is to delay--by X number of memory clock
