3570:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * All bits set in this field mask corresponding bits in data fields
3571:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * i.e. mt_error and mt_error_hold will not be set for errors in
3572:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * those fields
3573:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     *
3574:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * Structure of 144 bits same as DFI bus
3575:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * 36 bits per lane ( 8 physical * 4) + (1ECC * 4) = 36
3576:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     *
3577:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * If we wrote out the following pattern from software:
