4488:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * Post 2.0.109 version of Libero MSS core, weak pull up and pull down
4489:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * settings come from Libero, along with setting unused MSS DDR I/O to
4490:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * override.
4491:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *
4492:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  */
